      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : ".......Huhuhuhuhu~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "........It was your choice and my ability, no regret."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@equip_lv"
      ],
      "text" : "You want to refine a level {0} weapon?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "placeholders" : [
        "getitemname(.@item_req)",
        ".@price"
      ],
      "text" : "To refine that, you'll need to have one ^ff9999{0}^000000 and {1} zeny."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Would you like to continue?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Yes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "No"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Wow!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "This weapon probably"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "looks like it's been refined..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "many times..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "It may break if"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "you refine it again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "And if it breaks,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "you can't use it anymore!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "All the cards in it and the properties ^ff0000will be lost^000000!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "^ff0000Besides, the equipment will break!^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Are you sure you still want to continue?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Yes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "No"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Good."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Because if the weapon breaks from unreasonable refining, then I get a bad mood, too."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Giggle. Giggle. Oh, you have guts, daring to refine this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "You know it's pretty risky, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "If your defensive equipment is broken, you'll never be able to use it again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Even your cards and your modifications will ^ff0000completely disappear^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Do you really wish to continue?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Yes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "No"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "What nonsense. You waste my precious time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Get lost, punk."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Wait a second..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Do you think I'm stupid?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "You switched the item while I wasn't looking! Get out of here!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "Are these all you have?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "I'm very sorry, but I can't do anything without all the materials. Besides, I deserve some payments for my work, don't I?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "text" : "I can't help it even if you're not happy about it..."
    }
  ]
